Description:It is your first main phase. You control Monastery Swiftspear and have Raging Goblin and Faithless Looting in hand, with one red mana floating. The opponent is at 2 life and controls a tapped Silent Arbiter (no more than one creature can attack each combat). Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
